000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    TREQCHKT.
000400 AUTHOR.        K MOVSESIAN.
000900
001000**************************************************************
001100**                                                          **
001200**   T R E Q C H K T - CODES WITHOUT SUFFICIENT ORDER QTY   **
001300**                                                          **
001400**   THIS REPORT CHECKS ALL CODES WHERE 'AVAILABLE' (ONHAND **
001500**   LESS RESERVED) IS LESS THAN THE REORDER POINT TO SEE   **
001600**   IF THERE IS SUFFICIENT ORDER QUANTITIES TO TAKE THE    **
001700**   CODE BACK TO OR ABOVE THE REORDER POINT.  THIS REPORT  **
001800**   ACTS AS A 'SAFETY VALVE' FOR THE REQUISITION SYSTEM.   **
001900**                                                          **
002000**   THE FIRST CHECK IS TO SEE IF THE CODE WILL HAVE A      **
002100**   REQUISITION CREATED THE NEXT TIME 'MA1' IS EXECUTED.   **
002200**   IF IT DOES THEN THIS CODE WILL NOT BE CHECKED.         **
002300**   THE FOLLOWING QUANTITIES ARE ADDED TO 'AVAILABLE' AND  **
002400**   CHECKED TO MAKE SURE THE RESULT IS LESS THAN THE       **
002500**   REORDER POINT.                                         **
002600**       a) TOTAL STOREROOM ONORDER                         **
002700**       b) TOTAL STOREROOM OPEN REQUISITION(S) QUANTITY    **
002800**          INCLUDING THOSE REQUISITION(S) IN THE BATCH     **
002900**          SHIPPING RELEASE FILE                           **
003000**       c) TOTAL STOREROOM QUANTITY IN THE BATCH SHIPPING  **
003100**          RELEASE FILE THAT IS NOT ON REQUISITIONS        **
003200**       d) QUANTITY ON THE DOCK THAT IS NOT YET STORED.    **
003300**   IF ('AVAILABLE' + a + b + c + d) < REORDER THEN SHOW   **
003400**   CODE ON REPORT.                                        **
003500**                                                          **
003600**     XRSCREEN REPORT NO. - 45                             **
003700**     REPORT HEADER       - HDR45.PUB                      **
003800**     FORM NAME IN FRSCREEN - FREQCHKT                     **
003900**     R1 ON THE MATERIALS CONTROL MENU (UDCMC.PUB)         **
004000**                                                          **
004100**************************************************************
